Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790279999999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790207999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The 27 bars from 1787356800000 to 1789603200000 are a genuine trading range (2357.18-2680) with overlapping bars and no net progress, so much of the post-spike period is two-sided rather than a clean channel.", "The final bar 1790121600000 closed 2684.16, near the low of its range (close ~29%), back below the 2680 range top and the 2700 high of bar 1789776000000, so the breakout above the range has no follow-through yet.", "Bar 1787270400000 closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail after reaching 2771, showing sellers active near the highs; price then spent 27 bars below that high before exceeding it.", "The first ~70% of the window is a bear leg to 1368.42 plus a wide 1512.91-1974.46 range; a sustained bull trend is only visible from bar 1787097600000 onward, so the bull regime rests on the newer portion of the window."], "evidence_for": ["Two very large bull trend bars anchor the bull read: bar 1787097600000 (close 2252.16, top ~87% of range) and bar 1789948800000 (close 2775.61, top ~64% of a 208.3 range, new window high 2850).", "Swing sequence since the post-spike low is up: low 2358.62 (bar 1789430400000) held just above 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) and was followed by a higher high at 2850.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 closed on progressively higher levels and closed above the 2680 top of the preceding 27-bar range, i.e. a breakout attempt at the upper boundary rather than at the lower one.", "The current pullback is shallow so far: two bars and 2641.37, roughly a 42% retrace of the 2358.62-2850 leg, and far above the 2357.18 range low, so no higher low has been broken."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars from 1779840000000 to 1790207999999; window low 1368.42 (bar 1780704000000 low), window high 2850 (bar 1789948800000 high).", "Opening bear leg: bars 1779840000000-1780704000000 fell from bar-0 high 2094.02 to bar-10 low 1368.42, with five consecutive lower closes (1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55) and large bear ranges.", "Bars 1780790400000-1787011200000 stayed two-sided inside 1512.91 (bar-30 low) to 1974.46 (bar-61 high), heavy bar overlap, small bodies, no sustained trend.", "Bar 1787097600000 was the window's largest bull bar: open 1916.51, high 2293.8, low 1905.63, close 2252.16 (range 388.17, close in top ~87% of the bar).", "Bars 1787184000000-1787270400000 extended to highs 2348.02 and 2771, but the second closed 2515.3 with a 255.7 upper tail (close near 43% of its 445.69 range).", "Bars 1787356800000-1789603200000 traded sideways between 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000 low) and 2680 (bar 1789084800000 high) with overlapping bars and repeated two-sided closes.", "Bars 1789689600000-1789948800000 advanced from open 2446.22 to high 2850, closing above the 2680 top of that 27-bar range; the last bar of the leg, 1789948800000, closed 2775.61 in the top ~64% of its 208.3 range.", "Final two bars pulled back: 1789948800000 close 2752.43 and bar 1790121600000 open 2752.43, high 2786.81, low 2641.37, close 2684.16 (close near 29% of its 145.44 range), back below the 2680-2700 area.", "Pullback low 2641.37 retraces about 42% of the 2358.62-2850 advance, and recent swing sequence remains 2358.62 low (bar 1789430400000) vs 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) with a higher high at 2850."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: ten bars of lower closes from bar-0 high 2094.02 down to bar-10 low 1368.42, dominated by five consecutive large bear bars; the low was not revisited for the rest of the window.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779840000000, "upper_boundary": "2094.02"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the bear leg, from bar-30 low 1512.91 to bar-61 high 1974.46; overlapping bars, small bodies, no clean trend bars in either direction.", "end_time_ms": 1787011200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike from bar 1787097600000 (open 1916.51, close 2252.16, low 1905.63) through highs 2348.02 and 2771; the spike closed the range at 1512.91-1974.46 and is the largest single-bar expansion in the window.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range, 27 bars between bar 1788307200000 low 2357.18 and bar 1789084800000 high 2680; repeated overlapping bars and mid-bar closes show two-sided trading below the 2771 spike high.", "end_time_ms": 1789603200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Four-bar bull leg from bar 1789689600000 (open 2446.22, low 2436.87) up to the window high 2850 at bar 1789948800000, closing above the 2357.18-2680 range top; bars 1790035200000 and 1790121600000 then pulled back to 2641.37 and closed back below the 2680-2700 area, so acceptance above the range is not yet shown.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850, or two consecutive closes above 2786.81 (bar 1790121600000 high), would show acceptance above the range and make the current phase spike-like rather than channel-like.", "Range/failed breakout: a close below 2641.37 (bar 1790121600000 low) followed by a close below 2436.87 (bar 1789689600000 low) would return price into the 2357.18-2680 range and shift the read toward trading-range/range.", "Bull-trend invalidation: a close below 2357.18 would break the range low and the higher-low sequence, re-opening a bear leg toward the 1789430400000 low area.", "A sequence of overlapping bars holding between 2680 and 2850 with no new high would confirm the recent advance as a channel segment inside an increasingly range-like structure."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "unclear", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790265599999, "directional_pressure": "balanced", "evidence_against": ["Over the last 16-19 bars the market makes lower highs (2804.59 -> 2786.81 -> 2698.06 -> 2694.37) and lower lows (2716.01 -> 2648.49 -> 2633.31), i.e. a counter-trend leg rather than a bull channel continuation.", "Depth: 216.69 points retraced is about 44% of the 2358.62-2850.00 leg but about 77% of the final 2569.80-2850.00 push; the final close 2682.25 sits below that push's midpoint at 2709.90.", "Bar 100's 126.85 upper tail on a 191.94-range bar is a climactic exhaustion signature and 2850.00 has not been retested (bar 101 high 2795.00 is lower); the earlier long-tailed spike at bar 41 was likewise followed by a decline to 2358.62.", "The last 19 bars close roughly flat (2658.81 to 2682.25) with heavy overlap and small bodies, so the current state is two-sided; the bull reversal bar is a single bar without follow-through and bar 118 closed 2647.90 near its low.", "If the pullback continues, the whole 120-bar window can be relabeled a broad trading range bounded by 2358.62 and 2850.00, since the prior two up-spikes were retraced."], "evidence_for": ["Higher highs and higher lows run from 2358.62 (bar 66) to 2850.00 (bar 100), with wide bull bars (83, 84, 100) closing near their highs; this is the largest and most recent directional leg of the window.", "The pullback low 2633.31 (bar 118) holds above the prior higher low 2569.80 (bar 92) and above the bar-83/84 breakout area near 2580, so the bull trend's higher-low structure is unbroken.", "The final bar is a bull reversal bar (L 2640.00, C 2682.25, top 22% of range) that defended the 2633-2648 support zone after a marginal new low, and closes above the 50% retracement (2604.31) of the 2358.62-2850.00 leg.", "Net window change is +231.30 (+9.44%) with the latest close above the 20-bar midpoint, so the pullback has not undone the larger advance."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window spans 120 closed H4 bars, open 1788537600000 (O 2450.95) to open 1790251200000 (O 2647.90); net change +231.30 (+9.44%) to the final close 2682.25.", "Bars 0-40 form a wide two-sided range: extremes 2411.04 (bar 35, 1789041600000 low) and 2528.80 (bar 14, 1788739200000 high), with repeated tests of 2503-2529 (bars 9, 14, 28, 29) against 2441-2442 (bars 0, 23); closes stay inside 2436.83-2513.46.", "Bar 41 (1789128000000) is the widest bar of the window: O 2457.12 H 2680.00 L 2444.19 C 2555.52, a 235.81 range with a 124.48 upper tail and no follow-through above 2609.02 (bar 61 high, 1789416000000).", "Bars 61-66 reverse the push to 2609.02 and sell to 2358.62 (bar 66 low, 1789488000000), breaking the 2411.04 range low by 52.42 before bars 67-76 base between 2370.54 (bar 72) and 2450.87 (bar 75).", "From the 2358.62 low (bar 66) the market makes higher highs and higher lows to 2850.00 (bar 100, 1789977600000): +491.38 (+20.83%), with wide bull bars at 83 (C 2578.60), 84 (C 2636.28) and 100 (C 2723.15).", "Bar 100: O 2658.81 H 2850.00 L 2658.06 C 2723.15, a 191.94 range whose close sits 126.85 under the high; bar 101 then makes a lower high at 2795.00, so the 2850.00 extreme is untested.", "Since 2804.59 (bar 103 high, 1790020800000) the last 17 bars overlap between 2633.31 (bar 118 low, 1790236800000) and 2786.81 (bar 111 high, 1790136000000); successive highs step down 2804.59 -> 2786.81 -> 2698.06 (bar 117) -> 2694.37 (bar 119).", "Bars 104-119 net roughly flat (bar 104 open 2775.60 to final close 2682.25) with small bodies and heavy overlap; the last six bars form a tighter 2633.31-2698.06 shelf.", "The final bar (1790251200000) is a bull reversal bar: O 2647.90 H 2694.37 L 2640.00 C 2682.25, closing in the top 22% of its range and above bar 118's 2633.31 low, forming a small 2633.31/2640.00 support shelf with bars 113 (2648.49 low) and 118.", "The pullback low 2633.31 holds above the prior higher low 2569.80 (bar 92 low, 1789862400000), so the bull trend's higher-low sequence is not broken; the final close is also above the 50% retracement of the whole leg (2604.31)."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Early wide two-sided range of the window (bars 0-40), roughly 2410-2530: repeated failures near 2503-2529 against a 2441-2442 shelf, plus one spike low at 2411.04.", "end_time_ms": 1789113600000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788537600000, "upper_boundary": "2528.80"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 2358.62 low (bar 66) to the 2850.00 high (bar 100): higher highs and higher lows in spike-and-channel form (wide bull bars 83-84, pause 2612-2640, pullback to 2569.80 at bar 92, then the bar-100 acceleration). About 34 bars and +20.8%.", "end_time_ms": 1789977600000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Buy-climax spike at the top: bar 100 (1789977600000) opens 2658.81, runs to 2850.00 and closes 2723.15, leaving a 126.85 upper tail; bar 101 caps lower at 2795.00 and the market has gone sideways-to-down for about 19 bars since.", "end_time_ms": 1789992000000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-climax pullback range: bars 103-119 overlap between 2633.31 (bar 118) and 2804.59 (bar 103), with a tighter 2633.31-2698.06 shelf across the last six bars and a mild bear tilt from lower highs.", "end_time_ms": 1790251200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790020800000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Possible, unconfirmed MTR-like sequence at the high: 2850.00 top (bar 100), break below the 2716.01 swing low to 2648.49 (bar 113), lower high 2698.06 (bar 117), then a marginal lower low 2633.31 (bar 118) that the final bull reversal bar rejects. No reversal is established and the 2569.80 higher low is intact.", "end_time_ms": 1790251200000, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull resumption: an H4 close above 2786.81 (bar 111 high) and then above 2804.59 (bar 103 high) would break the post-climax range top and restore a bull-trend-continuation read.", "Bear shift: an H4 close below 2633.31 (bar 118 low) with follow-through under 2569.80 (bar 92 higher low) would confirm the lower-high/lower-low sequence and support a bear-leg or MTR continuation read.", "Range continuation: continued overlapping closes between about 2633.31 and 2698.06 keep the pullback-range classification; a cluster of unusually small overlapping bars in that band would mark a tighter breakout mode with unresolved direction.", "A bull bar closing back above 2727.77 (bar 113 high) would end the recent sequence of lower highs and argue the pullback is a completed bull flag."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2634.57", "close_time_ms": 1789851599999, "high": "2639.17", "low": "2632.31", "open": "2633.54", "open_time_ms": 1789848000000, "volume": "1503349.631"}, {"close": "2626.71", "close_time_ms": 1789855199999, "high": "2637.88", "low": "2621.15", "open": "2634.57", "open_time_ms": 1789851600000, "volume": "1829584.138"}, {"close": "2629.84", "close_time_ms"